    "body": "Mmm, I see. I wonder if this is worth documenting here since it seems like it'll cause additional confusion (talking about shell-specific escape sequences when discussing general format options seems like a very niche case). Perhaps we want to just this in the custom section and then leave this unspecified in the general case for now?\r\n\r\nI'm open to other suggestions as well, but I feel like if I'm a typical user, trying to understand exactly what this section means (and more specifically, what it means to me and what I want to do) seems quite difficult without understanding the entire context that this PR (#3107) exists in.",
